    Bug 2055328 - Turn account hub header banner into a web component. r=tobyp,freaktechnik

    The Account Hub notification banner uses the common Bolt 'Banner' design component style, but isn't currently re-usable outside of the header. This is the first phase of converting the work done for the AH notification banner, into a reusable component. It does not include the more advanced 'update' functionality available in the AH header file. That work is planned for a follow-up bug.

    This is functional enough for static use, specifically to complete bug 2055083, which will use this new Banner component.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315466

